Dear Tom,
&nbsp;
Thank you for sending this through and for your review of AF’s figures.
&nbsp;
Please could you urgently check this morning the fees for Russell Hopkins, Jon McDonagh, and Sophie Holcombe as well, as these were specifically
 queried by Alain. It would be helpful to confirm whether there are any discrepancies or points requiring clarification on those.
&nbsp;
I have also attached the most recent version of the Statement of Costs, if that helps.

&nbsp;
Do let us know if you need any further information from us to assist with this review.
&nbsp;
Kind regards,

