Dear Ben,
&nbsp;
I trust this email finds you well.
&nbsp;
Following our BHP costs call last week, we wanted to confirm whether we are still on track to receive the preliminary figures and the statement of costs later today.
&nbsp;
To give you context, our timetable is as follows:

Tuesday, 2 December (Tomorrow): Submission of the draft consequential agenda and our costs position to the Defendants.Friday, 5 December: &nbsp;Parties to file and serve our costs application/evidence.
&nbsp;
We need the figures today to keep this timetable on track. Please confirm if everything is proceeding as planned or let us know immediately if there are any issues.
Thank you for your assistance.
&nbsp;
Kind regards,
&nbsp;
Georgina Hope
