 that we can investigate immediately.
As you are aware, the firm has already taken robust action against Tom Goodhead.&nbsp; We take our obligations to our stakeholders extremely seriously and there is not, therefore, any basis for you to seek to exit early.&nbsp;
 Even if there has been improper behaviour at the Firm – and rest assured, we will investigate any such allegations seriously – that does not give you any justification, under either your contract or your regulatory obligations. Conjecture about what may or
 may not be published in The Times&nbsp;does not change that position.
