&nbsp;
Lead Solicitor
&nbsp;
The Firm has in consultation with the other Lead Solicitor and subject to the Court’s approval decided to step down temporarily as Lead Solicitor
 in the lead cases.&nbsp; This will obviate any attempt by the Defendants to distract the proceedings tactically by (unmerited) references to our personnel/legal team changes.&nbsp; The firm remains a fully active member of the Steering Committee, and is in the process
